{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>颱風薔琵｜香港航空取消周四往返沖繩航班　台北航班周四至六或受影響</strong></p><p>・香港航空取消周四沖繩航班<br>・颱風可能影響台北航班<br>・航班改動由周四起出現<br>・旅客須留意航空公司公告</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/本地/1059632/颱風薔琵-香港航空取消周四往返沖繩航班-台北航班周四至六或受影響\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:01:47.004543+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T19:37:54.684957+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:58:04.794346+00:00","content_hash":"a82215ff14d8f5dea1b1c45f8c0869495361917110f4234e40849bae089f2dd1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}